{"seq":23,"slug":"agent-orchestration","title":"Agent 编排与多智能体协作","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"agent-编排与多智能体协作\">Agent 编排与多智能体协作</h1><p>一个能写代码的 agent 已经不稀奇，难的是让一群 agent 围绕同一个目标分头干活，还不互相踩脚、不重复劳动、不把上下文搞丢。当你想让多个编码 agent 同时改一个仓库、分别调研不同子问题、或沿着「需求→实现→测试→评审」的链条接力时，真正的工程问题就从「单个 agent 的提示词」转移到了「这群 agent 怎么组织」。这个 hub 讲的就是这件事：多智能体系统的编排与协作。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 按四条主线递进，从「要不要」一直走到「怎么稳住」。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是<strong>基础</strong>。它先回答最该被质疑的问题：为什么要多智能体——多数任务一个 agent 就够，盲目上多体只会把 token 成本翻十几倍。接着把单体与多体放在同一张天平上称，给出明确的取舍判据，最后鸟瞰式地铺开三类编排拓扑，作为后文的地图。基础这一章决定了你会不会一开始就走错路。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是<strong>编排模式</strong>。地图铺开之后，逐一深讲三类核心拓扑：主管-工人的中心化委派、流水线式的顺序交接、以及并行扇出的广度搜索。每种拓扑都有它擅长的任务形状和会犯的错，这一章让你能照着任务结构挑出对的骨架。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是<strong>协调机制</strong>。拓扑只是骨架，agent 之间真正怎么共享信息、怎么对话、出了分歧怎么裁决，才是系统能不能跑通的关键。这一章拆开共享上下文与记忆、通信协议、以及冲突解决三块，它们正好对应多智能体失败统计里占比最大的那一类——智能体间错位。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是<strong>工程实践</strong>。最后落到地面：用哪个框架、成本怎么算、怎么观测一个分布式的 agent 系统，以及那些反复让人翻车的陷阱与边界。这一章承认一个朴素事实——多智能体系统大部分是被运维细节而非算法拖垮的。</p>\n<p>四条线连起来是一条完整的判断链：先想清楚该不该用多体，再选对拓扑，再让它们协调得起来，最后让它在生产里活下去。建议按顺序读；若你已经在做某个具体决策，也可以从对应章节切入，文档之间用相对链接互相指引，构成一张可以来回跳的知识网。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-multi-agent","title":"为什么多智能体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/foundations/why-multi-agent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"single-vs-multi","title":"单体与多体权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/foundations/single-vs-multi"},{"seq":3,"slug":"orchestration-patterns","title":"编排模式总览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/foundations/orchestration-patterns"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"编排模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supervisor-worker","title":"主管-工人模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/patterns/supervisor-worker"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-handoff","title":"流水线与交接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/patterns/pipeline-handoff"},{"seq":3,"slug":"parallel-fanout","title":"并行扇出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/patterns/parallel-fanout"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"coordination","title":"协调机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/coordination","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-context-memory","title":"共享上下文与记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/coordination/shared-context-memory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-protocols","title":"通信协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/coordination/communication-protocols"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-resolution","title":"冲突解决","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/coordination/conflict-resolution"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frameworks-tooling","title":"框架与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/practice/frameworks-tooling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-observability","title":"成本与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/practice/cost-observability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/practice/pitfalls"}]}]}